  "details": "I am trying to update a very old avatar (last update:2022/09/10), and receiving Application Error and ApiErrorException.\n\nUploading the same avatar as a new one succeeds without any problems.\n\nOverwriting a different (newer) avatar with it was also successful.\n\nI tried re-installing the SDK, restarting Unity and making a new project. None of them worked.\n\nI guess somehow access to some of my own Blueprint IDs is rejected. \n\nI can see the avatars in the Content tub, so I am sure the IDs are associated to my VRC ID.\n\nOther avatars in the same project encounter the same issue. They are also old ones.\n\nI can provide you with the specific errors and IDs if needed.\n\n(I am sorry I have posted this to the general Bug Reports category. I have deleted it and now reposting to this in the correct category)\n\nThank you.",
